Description: Lyra provides incorrect data or advice (from model or tools) that leads to suboptimal or harmful decisions.
Impact Definition: Cost of time lost, travel delays, wrong repairs, resource waste, or missed opportunities.
Probability Definition: Annual chance of a consequential misinformation event that the user acts on.
Inputs Needed:
    i_min:
    i_mode:
    i_max:
    p_alpha:
    p_beta:
